            "review_title": "Review at Mon Ngon Viet Nam",
            "review_text": "Jeanniesggbridge\nBangkok, Thailand46 contributions\n0\nAn excellent new gem of a restaurant\nFeb 2017 • Couples\nWell known Vietnamese-American food writer Andrea Nguyen mentioned this recently opened restaurant that combines a creative contemporary take on Vietnam's regional food. The dishes we enjoyed were not only delicious and of generous portions, the presentation was beautiful. The staff is friendly and attentive, the ingredients of the dishes were fresh and unusual. We had a fish ball soup that included fresh loofa. We especially enjoyed the Bahn veo, a Vietnamese pancake with shrimp and pork. \nThey are on an offshoot of the the main street at 72/1 Tran Quoc Toan.\nRead more\nWritten February 18, 2017",
