            "review_text": "1010GES\nLausanne, Switzerland25 contributions\n0\nEating in Saigon : Start Here !\nAug 2016 • Family\nIf you want to get a full experience of vietnamese cuisine, this is the place. The dishes are incredibly varied, from all regions of Vietnam. Vegetarians and omnivores welcome. If you can't decide from the extensive menu, you can wander around, as many of the dishes are prepared right in front of the customers. Just finger point. Staff is very helpful. Drink Saigon beer or coconut water. The setting is great, the place is bustling with life, odours and noise. Perfect introduction to Vietnam !\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 18, 2016",
