            "review_text": "tuantang\nSingapore15 contributions\n0\nDelicious Vietnamese cuisine with more than what you have known!\nMay 2016 • Family\nI have been here a few times with my families and friends and the only reason is that we can taste Vietnamese food like no elsewhere. Not only the menu is plentiful, the food tastes that we have tried have never disappointed us. Thanks to the restaurant' owner, also a well-known celebrity chef who has been invited to cook for international diplomats and popular cooking shows in Vietnam. Try their \"must try\" mixture stir fried abalone and taste abalone the Vietnamese way. Strongly recommended for tourists who want to try Vietnamese cuisine like you have never tried before or get bored with popular dishes like Pho, Spring rolls....\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 30, 2016",
